-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

LogicBBS is both a commercial & shareware product. You will be able to
find new updates out on bulletin systems. Allthough we have released
a fully working, unlimited, version for use by all users, we do expect
people to buy a commercial version of the product, and become owner of
a our product, and support the future development of the product.

Future versions will be limited in performance. You will be given 30
days to evaluate our product, and thereafter you must buy the product
from us. We offer you the full product at this moment for free, 
giving you a reasonable chance of looking into our product, and
for you to decide if you want to buy it.


You will be able to get all updates, directly from our Support BBS,
and if you wish, you can also get your commercial copy, directly from
this system. After you have sent the money to us. You need to log on to
our support bbs, and make yourself an account. When we have your payment,
you can call the BBS, and download the commercial version right away.





                               You pay only DKR 400 (Danish Kroner).


