There are several ways of ordering our product.


Payment by cheque.
*----------------*
If you wish to pay by cheque, do the following:
Go to a bank , and make them write a cheque made payable in Danish kroner.
Europeans can get a EUROCHEQUE, countries outside Europe can ask their bank
for help on getting a cheque in danish kroner. If they cannot find out
how to get a cheque in danish currency, you must send us money in your own
currency which is covering the danish price, AND add another 50,- Danish kroner
because exchange rates in Denmark are high, and we do not want to pay for your
lazyness. If you prefere using other methods of paying, read below.

All cheques must be made payable, in danish kroner (Dkr 400,-) to:

Michael Pendec
Islandshoejparken 14, 3 TV.
DK-2990 Nivaa
DENMARK



Payment by cash or bank transfer.
*-------------------------------*
Your local bank offers you a alternative method of payment.
Ask your bank how you can make a bank transfer. State the currency in danish
kroner, on the papers you must fill out.
We will receive a bank information note, about the money transfered to the
bank account and all you need to do becide this, is send us a letter stating
your payment is being made by banktransfer.

